that contribution or feedback into Nodics products and services.

You represent that you have the rights necessary to submit any contribution or
feedback you provide.

12. Confidentiality

The Licensed Materials include confidential and proprietary information of
Nodics. You must protect the Licensed Materials using at least reasonable care
