Upon reasonable notice, Nodics may request written certification of compliance.
If Nodics reasonably believes a material breach has occurred, Nodics may audit
your compliance through a mutually agreed process designed to protect your
confidential information and business operations.

16. Term and Termination

This license begins when you first access, copy, use, modify, or deploy the
Licensed Materials and continues until terminated.

Your rights terminate automatically if you breach this license and fail to cure
the breach within 30 days after written notice, or immediately for uncured
unauthorized resale, hosted-service offering, license circumvention,
confidentiality breach, or infringement of Nodics intellectual property.

Upon termination, you must stop using the Licensed Materials, stop distributing
or operating unauthorized Applications, and delete or return Licensed Materials
except for legally required archival copies that remain subject to this license.

Sections concerning ownership, confidentiality, restrictions, payment or
commercial obligations, audit, warranty disclaimer, liability limitation,
termination effects, governing law, and dispute resolution survive termination.

